+## v34 camera confirmation
+
+The camera outline is translucent, so it need not be bright white. Selection
+confirmation now recognises thin lines by their local contrast and rectangular
+geometry, including dim or darker outlines over light terrain and antialiased
+captures. A confirmed selection closes the map and proceeds to inspection.
+A click ripple, plain bright ground or a rectangle offset from the selected
+point cannot acknowledge that target. Genuine ignored clicks still get one
+retry against fresh recognition and remain unchecked if unsuccessful.
+
+This correction adds no fixed wait and changes no input boundaries, control
+boxes or padding. Daily collection/return, Gem Spy, routes and history remain.
